  "description": "Jungle Jive-l2 is a larger version of the flower-canopy design, made for children aged 5 to 12. Under the canopy there is a slide, a tunnel and a climbing net, with activity arms reaching out from the main tower. Children balance, hop and crawl along the lower parts and climb the net to reach the slide, so it builds more physical challenge than the l1. The product area is 30' x 23'4\" and the safe play area is 36' x 28'4\", which suits a school or a society with older children. Colour is listed as Multi Color, and capacity is listed as 15 children. The 3-year warranty on Jungle Jive-l2 covers galvanised pipes, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope. We can suggest where to place it so the tunnel entry stays visible to parents.",
